  <h1>The Splice Questions After RH</h1>
  <p class="lede muted">The RH archive changes the standard of evidence, not the constants in the theory.
    It offers transform methods, positivity tests and warnings about finite cancellation. It does not derive
    the action, physical scale, charge normalisation or reference radius the splice still owes.</p>
