    <h2 id="t-rh-energy-spin-colour">Can spin and colour close the critical-energy theorem?</h2>
    <p>Not by multiplicity alone. If the critical energy estimate were proved, it would conditionally close every
      exact zeta-side object already constructed: \(p_n=e^{o(n)}\), RH, zero horizontal residue, unit seam
